The Ultimate Cost Hack: Scale to Zero
Because Fly.io charges by the second, the secret to keeping your cloud bill near zero during testing (and profitable during production) is configuring the machines to Scale to Zero.

You configure your Fly.toml file so that the server automatically turns itself off when no one is talking to the AI. When a user clicks the [Interrogate] button on your Vercel frontend, Fly.io wakes the machine up in about 300 milliseconds. The meter ticks for the 15 minutes they are consulting, and when they hang up, the machine powers down, and the billing stops.

